<title>UK: Cie Bancaire sets $300 mln one-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire sets $300 mln one-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Barclays de Zoete Wedd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMPAGNIE BANCAIRE</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    16.JUL.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -1/16     PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A1/A	ISS PRICE  100.028   FULL FEES   5 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    2.5 BP    SELL CONC  2.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
